sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor Member
  participant Browser
  participant NextJS as Next.js API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Queue as BullMQ / Redis
  participant Fapshi as Fapshi API
  participant MoMo as MTN MoMo / Orange Money
  participant Blockchain as Polygon Contract

  Note over Member,Blockchain: Payment Contribution Flow

  Member->>Browser: Click "Pay Now"
  Browser->>NextJS: POST /api/payments/initialize
  NextJS->>DB: Create Payment (PENDING)
  NextJS->>DB: Create Contribution (PENDING)
  NextJS->>Queue: Enqueue payment-retry job (120s delay)
  NextJS->>Fapshi: POST /initiate-pay
  Fapshi-->>NextJS: 200 OK { transId }
  NextJS->>DB: Store providerRef = transId
  NextJS-->>Browser: 200 OK { paymentId }
  Browser-->>Member: "Check your phone for USSD prompt"

  Fapshi->>MoMo: Push USSD to member's phone
  MoMo-->>Member: USSD menu appears

  alt Member approves on phone
    Member->>MoMo: Approve payment
    MoMo-->>Fapshi: SUCCESSFUL
    Fapshi->>NextJS: POST /api/payments/webhook { status: SUCCESSFUL }
    NextJS->>DB: Payment → COMPLETED
    NextJS->>DB: Contribution → PAID
    NextJS->>Queue: Enqueue notification
  else Member ignores — BullMQ polls after 120s
    Queue->>NextJS: Fire payment-retry job
    NextJS->>Fapshi: GET /payment-status/{transId}
    Fapshi-->>NextJS: FAILED
    alt retryCount < 3
      NextJS->>Queue: Re-enqueue with backoff
    else retryCount = 3
      NextJS->>DB: Payment → FAILED
      NextJS->>DB: Membership.isDelinquent = true
      NextJS->>Queue: Notify delinquency
    end
  end

  Note over Member,Blockchain: Payout Trigger

  NextJS->>DB: All Contributions PAID this cycle?
  DB-->>NextJS: Yes
  NextJS->>DB: Get current recipient (rotation)
  NextJS->>DB: Create Payout (PENDING)
  NextJS->>Fapshi: POST /transfer { phone, amount }

  alt Transfer succeeds
    Fapshi-->>NextJS: SUCCESSFUL
    NextJS->>DB: Payout → COMPLETED
    NextJS->>DB: Increment cycle & recipientIndex
    NextJS->>Blockchain: recordCycleComplete()
    Blockchain-->>NextJS: txHash
    NextJS->>Queue: Notify recipient
  else Transfer fails (up to 3 retries)
    Fapshi-->>NextJS: Error
    NextJS->>Queue: Enqueue payout-retry
    NextJS->>DB: Payout → HELD (escrow)
    NextJS->>Queue: Notify admin + recipient
  end
